The registry-first sample tests/registry/cz.jsonl contains addresses and coordinates from
ČÚZK's RÚIAN address and hierarchy exports of 2026-09-30. © Český úřad zeměměřický a
katastrální, licensed under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Source: https://atom.cuzk.gov.cz/RUIAN-CSV-ADR-ST/RUIAN-CSV-ADR-ST.xml and
https://atom.cuzk.gov.cz/RUIAN-CSV-HIE-ST/RUIAN-CSV-HIE-ST.xml.
Coordinates were transformed from S-JTSK to EPSG:4326 with DuckDB spatial / PROJ, and
queries were constructed from registry fields. Per-case prepared-CSV checksums and
retrieval dates are recorded in the corpus; docs/evaluation/registry/cz.md records the upstream checksums.
